  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DevNote
  note: "FLIGHT TUNING\nNumbers (feel): edit Assets/Data/BirdStats.asset in the Inspector\n 
    - flyAcceleration = rise strength while holding Space\n  - jumpForce = max rise
    speed\n  - maxFallSpeed = glide speed (small negative = floaty)\n  - gravityScale
    = heaviness\nBehaviour (code): PlayerController2D.cs -> FixedUpdate -> the marked\nFLIGHT
    MOVEMENT block. TODO: change this behaviour of flight later."
